  // Average daily temperature range (°C) by month, Jan..Dec, from NASA POWER (MERRA-2).
  // Saint Pierre and Miquelon uses the nearest land cell (Burin Peninsula), since its own
  // grid cell is mostly ocean and understates the range. Ocean-dominated grid cells
